[00:00.000] 作曲 : Alexander Bradley/Joss Farrington/John Riley/Ryan Sheperson
[01:06.135]Portcullis of my eyes pry open
[01:09.750]Capitulated utterly
[01:11.682]Genuflection before the demiurge
[01:14.872]Lunar-bound and affixed in nebulic fluid
[01:18.256]Witnessing deterioration
[01:20.903]Disparate, The Thousand-Soul
[01:27.399]Snarled up in the friction of a 4D colluvium deposit
[01:31.725]And shunted into the dome
[01:33.474]Aloft the net organ squelching, darning impact hole
[01:43.721]A dim amaranthe / Fermenting black metallic / Steel world thruster
[01:52.567]Mindwarp! / Mindwarp! / Mindwarp!
[02:07.057]Zodiac infirmity
[02:26.690]Her words lingering…
[03:27.779]Descend deeper into the construct
[03:32.750]Rusting crawl space, quaking jolt
[03:37.289]Roaming masses, corridor glimpse
[03:41.382]Mindful of naught but decay
[05:05.085]Foolish distraction, amassing throng
[05:08.223]Rising from a nest of premonitions
[05:11.486]Claustrophobic air-vent stow away
[05:14.796]Glimpse human figure, passer-by nonchalant!
[05:49.291]Presbyopic disruption
[05:53.828]You’re feeling really strange
[05:58.361]A so weird feeling
[06:03.375]Those lanterns wailing
[06:13.147]Realise the identical fly suit
[06:15.469]Noirette locks start to swelter
[06:17.706]Iris corners without convexity
[06:20.031]Fully hexagonal and perfect
[06:27.573]Dismantled vertebrae warps the chassis
[06:30.008]Malfunctioned paunch spewing blubber
[06:37.990]I stand before the ganglionic limbs
[06:40.457]Eyes protruding from sextuplet corners
[06:48.702]Solemn watch of sullied disciples
[06:51.083]Foul progeny, disgusting spawn
[06:53.823]Then we’re flung into a vacuous vacuum
[06:56.523]Hurling bodies grasping ozone
[07:44.871]Regain principal axes, rail system transit
[07:48.411]Blast-off, ice-claw clasp
[07:49.890]Pulsating biological communiqué
[07:53.425]Uncontrolled vectors, plowing through orbital debris
[07:57.411]Metrachronal wave gait rhythm
[07:59.348]Sand clogged spiracle breath, shimmering trace
[08:09.720]Plummet into dunes / Water discipline / Severe desert heave
[08:18.424]Mindwarp! / Mindwarp! / Mindwarp!
[08:32.750]Progressive hexagonal ophthalmology
[08:36.209]Sandstones quivering, temporal imprints
[08:39.447]The sound of hissing vapor ridges
[08:42.806]Djinn of the Sarandib - Lier-in-wait!
[08:46.163]Optic chiasma synchronise
[08:52.549]Purring garment in crystal haze
[08:55.727]Angel of dis, spark bolt ricochet
[08:59.042]Glistening exorcism atop galloping insectoid
[09:02.347]Tangled in chitin invertebrate matrix
[09:51.620]“EDIN NA ZU!”
